    {
      "source": "<a href=\"TypeInformationMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>TypeInformationMapper</code></a> implementation that can be either set up using a <a href=\"../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> or manually set\nup <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> aliases to types. If a <a href=\"../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> is used the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> will be build\ninspecting the <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> instances for type alias information.",
      "translation": "一个 `<code>TypeInformationMapper</code>` 的实现，该实现可以通过 `<a href=\"../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>` 进行配置，也可以手动设置一个将 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>` 中的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a>` 别名映射到类型的配置。如果使用 `<a href=\"../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>`，则会在检查 `<a href=\"../mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>` 实例以获取类型别名信息的过程中构建该 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
